# mkdocs build output
site/

# Scenario results workbooks — regenerate-on-demand (OPERATING_MODEL Rule 26);
# committed scenario figures are inventoried in each outputs/MANIFEST.md
scenarios/*/*/outputs/*.xlsx

# MODTRAN tape5 decks — deterministic from modtran_run_matrix.csv via
# scripts/render_modtran_decks.py; regenerate-on-demand (Rule 26), not
# committed. Real tape7 outputs (once obtained externally) are placed
# by hand under tests/integration/fixtures/modtran/ or data/atmospheres/
# per docs/plans/MODTRAN_Run_Matrix_Plan.md §7, not here.
modtran/decks/

# Real MODTRAN outputs — gitignored local staging for the 2026-07-17
# run set (39 tape7 + 4 E-block flux CSVs, ~296 MB). NOT a permanent
# home: once the parser reads them and golden tests pass, the fixture
# subset is committed to tests/integration/fixtures/modtran/ and the
# shipped subset repackaged into data/atmospheres/ per plan §7. These
# cannot be regenerated locally (no MODTRAN binary), so preserve them.
# See modtran/real_runs/README.md for the provenance manifest.
# Both forms: 'real_runs/' ignores the directory contents; bare
# 'real_runs' also refuses a FILE or SYMLINK at that path — a tracked
# symlink slipped through the dir-only pattern on 2026-07-20 and its
# checkout clobbered the ignored (irreplaceable) staged delivery.
# Integrity: the SHA-256 checksums of the staged data are committed as the
# SIBLING file 'modtran/real_runs_MANIFEST.sha256' (outside this ignore, so
# the dir+symlink guard above stays intact) — regenerate/verify via
# scripts/gen_modtran_manifest.py, gated by tests/integration/test_modtran_manifest.py
# (CU-174). Keep a second copy of the original delivery outside the repo.
modtran/real_runs/
modtran/real_runs

# Synthetic (NOT real) tape7 outputs — deterministic from
# modtran_run_matrix.csv via scripts/generate_synthetic_tape7.py;
# regenerate-on-demand (Rule 26), not committed. See
# modtran/synthetic/README.md for what these are (and are not) for.
modtran/synthetic/*.tp7
modtran/synthetic/_cache/

# Data files (large assets shipped separately)
data/solar/*.bin
data/atmospheres/*.bin

# Golden result backups
tests/golden/*.bak

# Test artifacts (regeneratable plots)
src/radiant/atmosphere/tests/artifacts/
scenarios/04_lisa_analyst/4.3_camouflage_effectiveness/outputs/derived/

# Local / transient Claude Code state (shared settings.json IS committed)
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/worktrees/
